{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1a6YczYoruR3iAHHjR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**No, don't start it now. Revisit in March.**\n\n**Why not now**\n- **It breaks the year's main bet.** Filing needs all four engineers until March. Moving two of them to the app roughly halves filing capacity, which pushes it toward or past the April deadline. A late filing feature costs you customers outright. A late receipt app doesn't.\n- **The timeline has no slack.** \"60% done\" estimates usually run long. With a fixed regulatory date, you need buffer, not fewer people.\n- **The demand signals are weak.** Blog searches for \"receipts\" show interest in the topic, not that people will pay for or switch to an app. One competitor launching something doesn't mean you're losing deals. Ask sales and support whether anyone has actually churned or stalled over this.\n- **A second platform costs more than three months.** A mobile app means app store releases, OCR (text extraction) edge cases and ongoing support, all landing on a four-person team after launch.\n\n**What to do instead**\n- **Treat receipts as part of filing.** Quarterly filing needs categorised expenses. Pitch receipt capture as \"the easiest way to get your quarter ready,\" so it supports the main strategy instead of competing with it.\n- **Give marketing something now with no engineering cost.** That could be content that ranks for the receipts search traffic, or promoting an existing receipt-capture tool that integrates with you, if one exists.\n- **After filing ships,** build the smallest useful version first, such as photo upload in your web app or email-in receipts, before committing to a native app.\n- **Set a trigger to revisit:** \"If we lose X deals over receipts, or filing is clearly ahead of schedule by January, we reassess.\"\n\nMarketing is right that receipts matter. Now just isn't the time."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3189,"cache_read_input_tokens":5025,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3189},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d33a4907-c729-4f89-ae25-a186b32ce147","uuid":"0feab0b2-b8ff-4d78-9c9b-879476a295c2","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:13:59.164Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1a6FVoc6o5P4DCQoU2"}
